 "assumptions": [
  "ssimulacra1 = metrics/ssimulacra1.rs::score (ssimulacra1.rs:192-260) \u2014 original Cloudinary SSIMULACRA (2017), RGB8 sRGB.",
  "Ingress per px per img (ssimulacra1.rs:16-63): 3-entry sRGB->linear LUT gathers; 3 dots r*cx+g*cy+b*cz (9 mul + 6 add); 3 f() = pow(1/3)+sub (common path) ; 3 outputs: y*1.16 mul, 0.39+2.27*(x-y) fma+sub, 0.49+0.91*(y-z) fma+sub.",
  "Per scale (up to 6, while w,h>=8) per channel (ssimulacra1.rs:204-258): 5 blurs (mx,my,exy,exx,eyy) + 3 product maps xy,xx,yy + SSIM-ish map + weighted average/grid/worst-4x4 pooling + decimate channels by 2 (area average) for next scale.",
  "blur (ssimulacra1.rs:77-131): 11-tap Gaussian sigma=1.5, BORDER_REFLECT_101; h-pass per elem 1 mul + 10 fma + 11 loads (interior; border reflect rare); v-pass symmetric: 1 mul + 5 add + 5 fma + 6 loads. Kernel build 11 exp + 11 div once \u2014 omitted (amortized).",
  "map per elem (ssimulacra1.rs:223-230): mu2 (2 mul), sigma12 (1 mul + 2 add), num (1 add + 1 mul), musq (2 mul + 1 add), denom (3 add + 1 mul), div = mul7 add7 div1.",
  "edge (scale 0 only, ssimulacra1.rs:232-234): 1 - max(|y-my| - |x-mx|, 0): 2 sub + 2 abs + 1 sub + 1 cmp per elem per channel.",
  "Pooling: average() f64 sums (1 cvt + 1 add per elem, div once); grid() row avg + col sums + 2 sorts (rows h\u00b7log h, cols w\u00b7log h comparisons, small); scale-0 extra: ew*avg(edge) + gw*grid(edge) + gw*grid(map) + avg(map).",
  "down(map,4) fast path: 4x4 area block = 15 add + 1 mul + 16 loads per out elem; worst = min fold (1 cmp/elem). down(x,2): generic path 4 add + 1 div + 4 loads per out elem.",
  "6th scale may not run on small images (w<8 break); dims halve via round_ties_even."
 ],
